      "function": "TT_Process_Simple_Glyph",
      "line": null,
      "code": "for ( ; vec < limit; vec++, unrounded++ )",
      "note": "Missing default-instance guard around the scaling loop. `unrounded` is initialized only on the variation-font path, but this loop still chooses it as the source coordinate array whenever `do_scale` is true. On the witnessed default-instance component path reached during composite expansion, the loop therefore carries an indeterminate stack pointer into the dereference at the sink. The fix adds an `IS_DEFAULT_INSTANCE` split here and scales default-instance outlines from `vec` directly.",
